     3,
     "\r<br>On Mon, Dec 9, 2013 at 5:32 AM,  &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">simonqi...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:\r<br>&gt; Hi,\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; recently, when I used plyr to convert some data, I got a whole column of NA\r<br>&gt; values.\r<br>&gt; For simplicity, I make a toy test code to demonstrate what I encountered:\r<br>&gt; ###########################################################################################\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt; acc &lt;- c(1.1, 1.2, 1.3, 2.1, 2.2, 2.3, 3.1, 3.2, 3.3)\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt; ds &lt;- rep(letters[1:3], each=3)\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt; r &lt;- data.frame(ds, acc)\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt; s &lt;- ddply(r, .(ds), summarise, acc=round(mean(acc), 4),\r<br>&gt;&gt; <a href=\"http://acc.sd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://acc.sd&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792358306000000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2nJSXHezrJBrjuhnELzord\">acc.sd</a>=round(sd(acc), 4))\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt; r\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;   ds acc\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 1  a 1.1\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 2  a 1.2\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 3  a 1.3\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 4  b 2.1\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 5  b 2.2\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 6  b 2.3\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 7  c 3.1\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 8  c 3.2\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 9  c 3.3\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt; s\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;   ds acc <a href=\"http://acc.sd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://acc.sd&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792358306000000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2nJSXHezrJBrjuhnELzord\">acc.sd</a>\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 1  a 1.2     NA\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 2  b 2.2     NA\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 3  c 3.2     NA\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; ###########################################################################################\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; However, When I change the first column name &quot;acc&quot; to something\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; that is not the prefix of the second column name, these NA values disappear.\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; ###########################################################################################\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt; s &lt;- ddply(r, .(ds), summarise, accs=round(mean(acc), 4),\r<br>&gt;&gt; <a href=\"http://acc.sd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://acc.sd&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792358306000000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2nJSXHezrJBrjuhnELzord\">acc.sd</a>=round(sd(acc), 4))\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;&gt; s\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;   ds accs <a href=\"http://acc.sd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://acc.sd&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792358306000000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2nJSXHezrJBrjuhnELzord\">acc.sd</a>\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 1  a  1.2    0.1\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 2  b  2.2    0.1\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; 3  c  3.2    0.1\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt; ###########################################################################################\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;\r<br>&gt;\r<br>"
